    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Make a Whale\ud83d\udc0b?</strong></h2><br>This is a fun and charming game where you connect adorable sea creatures and help them grow bigger. <br>When you match creatures of the same type, they progressively get larger. <br>The more you nurture them, the higher your score will rise, so keep growing them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Player and Multiplayer Modes!</strong></h2><br>There are both a single-player mode for focused play and a multiplayer mode for competing with friends and rivals from around the world. <br>In single player, you can focus on the growth of your sea creatures. <br>In multiplayer, you can enjoy strategic battles with opponents while competing in the growth of your sea friends.<br><br>You can also compete for high scores on the game's leaderboard. Engage in multiplayer battles and climb the score rankings to challenge rivals from all over the world.",
